      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "REALITY EINSTEIN (4) is an honest type in the frame at six of 12 starts including last time when third (26.42) over 460m at this track. Solid record here including two wins. Well placed here and can go close with a clear run. WHY NOT SEB (1) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing fifth (26.39) last time in a Grade 5 at Geelong. Has a good record at this journey. Has performed well from this box with a win and two minor placings to his name from five starts. Expected to run well. IMPACTING (5) has a strong winning strike-rate over this journey with three wins and a placing from eight tries. Was out of placings last time (26.54) at this track in a Grade 4/5, finishing fifth and beaten 11 lengths. Suited here and expected to run well. MYSTERY NELL (7) was below best last time at this track (26.32) in a Grade 5 FIN, finishing a 10 length sixth. Has two wins already from this draw.",
